        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "since waking up today the floaters turned into a sudden shower of dozens of dark specks and cobwebs in my right eye, and the flashing lights happen every time i look sideways in a dim hallway.",
